{"strongs": "H2404", "word": "חָטַב", "translit": "cha.tav", "root": "חזר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "cut or gather wood", "definition": "I. [ חָטַב ] verb cut or gather wood , usually firewood (Late Hebrew id. ; Arabic firewood , collect firewood (see Wetzst in De Ps 144:12 ); Ethiopic cut (or gather) firewood ) — Qal Imperfect יַחְטְבוּ Ezek 39:10 Infinitive לַחְטֹב Deut 19:5 Participle חֹטֵב Deut 29:10 plural חֹטְבִים 2Chr 2:9 construct חֹטְבֵי Josh 9:21 + 3 t.; passive plural feminine חֲטֻבוֺת Prov 7:16 — cut or gather wood, followed by accusative Deut 19:5 ; Deut 29:10 (|| שׁאב מים ); compare Ezek 39:10 מןהֿיערים (object in preceding clause); 2Chr 2:9 (|| כֹּרְתֵי הָעֵצִים ); Participle construct עצים ׳ ח Jer 46:22 , and (|| שֹׁאֲבֵי מַיִם ) Josh 9:21 ; Josh 9:23 ; Josh 9:27 . Pu`al Participle מְחֻטָּבוֺת Ps 144:12 meaning dubious; perhaps hewn (so, in substance, Thes MV SS Ew Che Bae ; see however II. חטב ), of corner-pillars ( זָוִיּוֺת see זָוִית above), simile of beautiful, stately daughters.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2700')\">BDB2700</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2404')\">H2404</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2699')\">BDB2699</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2701')\">BDB2701</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>חָטַב</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>cut or gather wood</highlightword>, usually <highlight>firewood</highlight> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder1718/> <highlight>firewood</highlight>, <placeholder1719/> <highlight>collect firewood</highlight> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wetzst')\">Wetzst</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De<sup>Ps 144:12</sup></lookup>); Ethiopic <placeholder1720/> <highlight>cut</highlight> (or gather) <highlight>firewood</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַחְטְבוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,10)\">Ezek 39:10</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>לַחְטֹב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 19:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,5)\">Deut 19:5</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>חֹטֵב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 29:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,10)\">Deut 29:10</ref> plural <bdbheb>חֹטְבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,9)\">2Chr 2:9</ref> construct <bdbheb>חֹטְבֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 9:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,21)\">Josh 9:21</ref> + 3 t.; passive plural feminine <bdbheb>חֲטֻבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 7:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,16)\">Prov 7:16</ref> — <highlight>cut or gather</highlight> wood, followed by accusative <ref ref=\"Deut 19:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,5)\">Deut 19:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 29:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,10)\">Deut 29:10</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שׁאב מים</bdbheb>); compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,10)\">Ezek 39:10</ref> <bdbheb>מןהֿיערים</bdbheb> (object in preceding clause); <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,9)\">2Chr 2:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>כֹּרְתֵי הָעֵצִים</bdbheb>); <highlight>Participle</highlight> construct <bdbheb>עצים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,22)\">Jer 46:22</ref>, and (|| <bdbheb>שֹׁאֲבֵי מַיִם</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Josh 9:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,21)\">Josh 9:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 9:23\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,23)\">Josh 9:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 9:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,27)\">Josh 9:27</ref>. <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְחֻטָּבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 144:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,12)\">Ps 144:12</ref> meaning dubious; perhaps <highlight>hewn</highlight> (so, in substance, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MV')\">MV</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup>; see however II. <bdbheb>חטב</bdbheb>), of corner-pillars (<bdbheb>זָוִיּוֺת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>זָוִית</reflink></bdbheb> above), simile of beautiful, stately daughters. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ezek 39:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 39, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Deut 19:5", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 19, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Deut 29:10", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 29, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "2Chr 2:9", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Josh 9:21", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Prov 7:16", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Jer 46:22", "book": "JER", "chapter": 46, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Josh 9:23", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Josh 9:27", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Ps 144:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 144, "verse": 12}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["חָטַב", "יַחְטְבוּ", "לַחְטֹב", "חֹטֵב", "חֹטְבִים", "חֹטְבֵי", "חֲטֻבוֺת", "שׁאב מים", "מןהֿיערים", "כֹּרְתֵי הָעֵצִים", "עצים", "׳", "ח", "שֹׁאֲבֵי מַיִם", "מְחֻטָּבוֺת", "חטב", "זָוִיּוֺת", "זָוִית"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Bae", "Che", "De", "Ew", "MV", "SS", "Thes", "